[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3936807082","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116551#issuecomment-3936807082","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116551","id":3936807082,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qpuiq","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T19:51:17Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T19:51:17Z","body":"Copying some additional notes from when I posted this in the discord:\nhttps://discord.com/channels/1235157165589794909/1474188161855787029/1474188161855787029\n\n\nI randomly get this error when assigning a new custom resource.\n\nReloading the saved scene or restarting the project seems to clear it out, but it comes back eventually if I do some combination of saving the scene with/without a resource assigned, and then clearing / re-adding the resource.\n\nIf I never save the scene, I don't normally seem to get this error.\nI also noticed if I clear the resource fast enough (right after creating it), I don't get the 2nd \"Set resource\" debug message in the output console.\n\nSometimes if I create and save quickly then clear and re-add it happens.\nI've yet to determine an exact consistent / repeatable sequence of actions that causes it.\n\nAt first I thought maybe it could be related to my plugin scripts in my active project, but I disabled all plugins and still got the same error. Then I went and made these simple sample projects and still got the error.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3936807082/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937072234","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116551#issuecomment-3937072234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116551","id":3937072234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qqvRq","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T20:43:03Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T20:43:03Z","body":"The error seems to arise in 4.5.beta1:\nhttps://godotengine.github.io/godot-interactive-changelog/#4.5-beta1\n\nI found 8 commits with \"Resource\" in the title; a number under Editor and Core:\n\n[Improve error messages in ResourceLoader\n#106720\n](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106720)\n\n[Fix ResourceSaver saving default value of Resource\n#107049\n](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107049)\n\n[Fix async resource loading progress on empty p_original_path\n#107114\n](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107114)\n\n[Fix resources wrongly duplicated upon instantiating inherited scenes\n#107219\n](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107219)\n\n[Fix script property of custom resources inherited from scripts are not saved\n#107355](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107355)\n\n[Add \"Paste as Unique\" option to the editor resource picker dropdown\n#103980\n](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103980)\n\n[Assign base path when creating Resource\n#106750\n](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106750)\n\n[Fix Resource Duplication test errors\n#107516\n](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107516)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937072234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937688567","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116551#issuecomment-3937688567","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116551","id":3937688567,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qtFv3","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://