following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-21T00:23:33Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T00:23:33Z","body":"> I can't reproduce this on 4.5.beta1 and 4.7.dev [c4a893e](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/c4a893e988935aa8401a9ab4d3dd29b96db4fa1a) (Linux). I've tried 30+ times by adding a SpriteFrames resource in the exported property, then mashing Ctrl + Z, Ctrl + S and Ctrl + Shift + Z in a random order.\n\nInteresting... I can't speak to linux, but I wasn't able to trigger it either using Undo/Redo commands. I had to manually clear and reassign the resource with the mouse to get the error.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3937753135/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3938503161","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116551#issuecomment-3938503161","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116551","id":3938503161,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qwMn5","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-21T09:22:28Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T09:22:28Z","body":"> ERROR: Another resource is loaded from path 'res://main.tscn::h2yge' (possible cyclic resource inclusion).\n\nThis error is printed at random times for me on 4.5.1. I could just be assigning a new resource or a built-in script (happens a lot more often) and the error will show up in the output window. But it doesn't seem to signify anything important (?) because everything works fine after that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3938503161/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3941202788","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116551#issuecomment-3941202788","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116551","id":3941202788,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7q6ftk","user":{"login":"ndbn","id":2904562,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDQ1NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2904562?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn","html_url":"https://github.com/ndbn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ndbn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-22T15:26:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-22T15:26:50Z","body":"Can confirm on 4.6, 4.6.1, Linux.\nSomething with caching/reusing hashes\n\n[main.gd](https://gist.github.com/ndbn/0f1528a64ff1166690d71a10db8343bc) with info \n\n- Need to generate resource 4-6 times\n- Save\n- Again generate resource 1-2 times\n- Save\n- Another generation gives error\n\n> Created: res://main.tscn::ulkan\n> Recreated: res://main.tscn::dugel\n> Recreated: res://main.tscn::f0nyw\n> Saved as: res://main.tscn::Curve_ig7tw\n> Recreated: res://main.tscn::0xm2m\n> Recreated: res://main.tscn::h2yge\n> Recreated: res://main.tscn::1bvp3\n> Saved as: res://main.tscn::Curve_ig7tw\n=Here again new resource=\n>   ERROR: Another resource is loaded from path 'res://main.tscn::0xm2m' (possible cyclic resource inclusion).\n(Also no resource_path at this moment)\n\nLooks like Godot generate hash `0xm2m` and try to load it because it was already generated....","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3941202788/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4060206898","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116551#issuecomment-4060206898","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116551","id":4060206898,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yAdcy","user":{"login":"max99x","id":680351,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDM1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/680351?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x","html_url":"https://github.com/max99x","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-14T10:07:39Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T10:08:39Z","body":"I'm seeing this as well, both in 4.5 and 4.6 (but not in the past in 4.4, though the project has changed since then).\n\nIn my case 1-3 instances of this error are thrown every time I launch my game, both in editor and in packaged builds. It mentions different (seemingly random) subresources. Often the resource mentioned in the error message is some sort of simple leaf like a NoiseTexture2D referenced only once (in its parent resource). The resource seems to work just fine despite the error, but it is concerning to not know whether this indicates a deeper failure down the line.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4060206898/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4227233872","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116551#issuecomment-4227233872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116551","id":4227233872,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc779nhQ","user":{"login":"GustJc","id":3084189,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQxODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc","html_url":"https://github.com/GustJc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GustJc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-10T22:58:41Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T22:58:41Z","body":"I have recently noticed this too. Confirmed it is happening in both 4.7 and 4.6.\nI've been able to very consistently reproduce, here are the steps:\n- Create a new scene and save it\n- Add a TileMapLayer node and create a new tilemap resource \n- Add an worldEnvironment node and create a new environment resource.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ad6ea2a-7278-4325-8dba-926c80ad1476\n\nIn this case it only shows up once and then never again.\nBut sometimes on more complex scenes it sometimes keep getting it over and over, even when just adding nodes sometimes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4227233872/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4297064093","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116551#issuecomment-4297064093","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116551","id":4297064093,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAB_-nQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-22T14:24:22Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T14:29:00Z","body":"It's a regression from #106750 (and later #107943)\nNew resources get assigned random path, which might sometimes clash. When you remove and create new resource, the old one still exists in memory (because of editing history), so clashes are more likely to happen.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4297064093/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]